  lines:
  - <bounce>Well, here's my room!</bounce>
  - <wiggle>I know it's a bit messy</wiggle>
  - <wave>But take a seat wherever you like!</wave>
  - <wave>Did you make all of these?</wave>
  - <bounce>Anything with the funny mouth, yep!</bounce>
  - <bounce>Mom and dad say I'm pretty good too!</bounce>
  - <pend>Must be nice</pend>
